{
    "background_story": "Amber was a brilliant archaeologist with a passion for uncovering the secrets of ancient civilizations. Her latest obsession was the mysterious barrow of a long-lost Celtic chieftain. Legend had it that the barrow held treasures beyond imagination, but many had attempted to excavate it before and failed. Undeterred, Amber spent years researching and planning her approach. Finally, she assembled a team of experts and began the painstaking process of uncovering the barrow's secrets. As they carefully excavated the site, they discovered a trove of artifacts and relics that shed new light on the region's history. Amber's dedication and expertise earned her international recognition, and she became known as one of the leading authorities on Celtic archaeology.",
